## 5. FILE ARCHITECTURE (Complete ES Module Map)

### Entry Point & Configuration
```
index.html                    # Vite entry, loads Space_Invaders/index.js
vite.config.js                # Dev server + ES module config
package.json                  # Dependencies: three@0.160.0
```

### Shared Layer (Reusable Across All Games)
```
shared/
├── index.js                  # Barrel export for all shared modules
├── constants.js              # NEON_COLORS, PHYSICS_CONSTANTS, BOUNDARIES
├── input.js                  # InputController class (Keyboard + Gamepad API unified)
├── math.js                   # lerp(), clamp(), randomRange(), AABB collision helpers
└── utils.js                  # disposeThreeJSObject(), performance timers

shared/audio/
├── index.js                  # Export: AudioSynth, MusicSequencer, Mixer
├── synthesizer.js            # SFX generation (oscillators, envelopes)
├── music.js                  # Procedural background music sequencer
└── mixer.js                  # Volume control, ducking on impact

shared/vfx/
├── index.js                  # Export all VFX classes
├── cameraShake.js            # CameraShake class (trauma-based)
├── particles.js              # ParticleManager class (500 cap, pooled)
├── hitStop.js                # HitStop class (frame freeze + ramp)
├── motionTrails.js           # MotionTrailRenderer class
├── shockwave.js              # ShockwaveManager class
└── floatingText.js           # FloatingTextManager class (3D + HTML modes)

shared/postprocessing/
├── index.js                  # Export: createComposer, createBloomPass
├── bloom.js                  # UnrealBloomPass factory with tuned params
└── composer.js               # EffectComposer setup helper

shared/pooling/
├── index.js                  # Export: ObjectPool class
└── pool.js                   # Generic typed object pool implementation
```

### Space Invaders Game Folder (Isolated)
