## 6. MEMORY MANAGEMENT CHECKLIST (Per File)

| Resource Type | Creation Point | Disposal Trigger | Method |
|--------------|----------------|------------------|--------|
| Geometries | `rendering/*.js` factories | Scene cleanup / wave reset | `geometry.dispose()` |
| Materials | `createNeonMaterial()` factory | Entity death (non-pooled) | `material.dispose()` |
| Textures | CanvasTexture from `generateAlienTexture()` | Wave transition | `texture.dispose(); texture.image = null` |
| Particles | `ParticleManager` pre-allocation | Never (pooled, recycled in-place) | N/A — pool persists |
| Projectiles | `ProjectilePool` pre-allocation | Never (pooled, recycled in-place) | N/A — pool persists |
| Floating Text Sprites | `FloatingTextManager.spawn3D()` | Lifetime expiry | `material.dispose(); sprite.parent.remove(sprite)` |
| Shockwave Meshes | `ShockwaveManager.spawn()` | Animation complete | `scene.remove(mesh); material.dispose()` |

